WEBVTT

00:02.720 --> 00:05.980
Kaede, we're out of ketchup. 
Could you buy some?

00:06.180 --> 00:07.520
Okay.

00:16.610 --> 00:17.980
So cold.

00:24.550 --> 00:26.810
<i>It's almost Valentine's Day.</i>

00:30.840 --> 00:31.820
For you.

00:37.350 --> 00:40.370
I wish Mie-san would give me some.

00:40.370 --> 00:41.520
Nah.

00:42.000 --> 00:44.520
Did someone just call me?

00:54.780 --> 00:55.860
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

00:55.860 --> 00:58.870
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

02:24.900 --> 02:27.930
I wish Mie-san would give me some.

02:27.930 --> 02:29.080
Nah.

02:30.350 --> 02:32.840
Did someone just call me?

02:33.470 --> 02:38.550
Episode 5

02:33.470 --> 02:38.550
I Met With the

02:33.470 --> 02:38.550
Girl I Like On Valentine's Day

02:34.390 --> 02:36.700
M-M-Mie-san!

02:36.700 --> 02:38.510
Huh? Komura-kun?

02:38.510 --> 02:39.820
What a coincidence.

02:39.820 --> 02:41.240
Shopping?

02:41.240 --> 02:42.700
Y-Yeah.

02:42.700 --> 02:44.180
Buying ketchup.

02:45.240 --> 02:47.520
<i>She's not in uniform!</i>

02:47.520 --> 02:49.940
<i>I can't believe I bumped into her like this.</i>

02:51.750 --> 02:55.440
<i>And I can't believe she's forgotten 
her glasses outside of school, too.</i>

02:56.860 --> 03:00.880
Mie-san, did you come all the way 
here without your glasses? From home?

03:00.880 --> 03:02.870
Shucks, how embarrassing.

03:03.580 --> 03:06.200
I mean, it's not that embarrassing, but...

03:06.200 --> 03:09.360
I'm used to this area, so I'll be okay.

03:09.360 --> 03:10.980
Y-Yeah?

03:10.980 --> 03:17.340
Also, Komura-kun, you said something 
about wishing I'd give you something...

03:17.940 --> 03:19.840
What were you talking about?

03:20.690 --> 03:23.260
<i>She heard me!</i>

03:23.780 --> 03:29.000
<i>I'd practically be confessing if she 
found out I want chocolates from her!</i>

03:31.410 --> 03:33.920
Well, err...

03:31.410 --> 03:33.920
<i>What if she rejects me on the spot?</i>

03:33.920 --> 03:35.770
<i>I'd have no choice but to die.</i>

03:37.360 --> 03:39.280
I think I'll pass.

03:40.010 --> 03:42.860
<i>She can't know I have feelings for her!</i>

03:44.290 --> 03:46.780
<i>The town's all Valentine's Day colored!</i>

03:48.740 --> 03:53.180
<i>That's enough to clue her 
in as to what I wanted.</i>

03:54.130 --> 03:57.480
<i>She's going to find out I have feelings!</i>

03:57.480 --> 04:00.460
<i>That's gonna be the end of my love life!</i>

04:01.160 --> 04:04.990
Is it just me, or is everything really red?

04:07.720 --> 04:09.660
Like, the scenery is.

04:11.690 --> 04:13.890
Maybe they're renovating.

04:12.640 --> 04:13.890
<i>I see!</i>

04:13.890 --> 04:15.150
<i>She doesn't see it!</i>

04:16.140 --> 04:18.790
<i>Which means she doesn't know I have feelings.</i>

04:18.790 --> 04:21.150
<i>I think I'm saved.</i>

04:22.960 --> 04:26.160
Oh, sorry, I was talking to myself.

04:26.160 --> 04:28.780
I-I gotta go to the supermarket.

04:30.050 --> 04:33.500
<i>Thank goodness we changed subjects.</i>

04:37.250 --> 04:40.450
My mom wants me to buy mayonnaise.

04:40.450 --> 04:42.300
My mom needs ketchup.

04:42.300 --> 04:46.000
<i>Shopping at the supermarket with Mie-san!</i>

04:46.000 --> 04:47.800
<i>It's like married life.</i>

04:49.120 --> 04:51.170
<i>What a happy coincidence.</i>

04:51.170 --> 04:55.050
<i>God just might be on my side today.</i>

04:55.050 --> 04:56.310
Hey, Komura-kun...

04:57.130 --> 04:58.600
What do you think that is?

04:58.600 --> 05:01.010
It looks like a king's grave.

05:01.570 --> 05:05.570
<i>Or maybe God is my enemy.</i>

05:06.200 --> 05:08.690
Well, see...

05:08.690 --> 05:11.250
Oh, I forgot to ask.

05:12.340 --> 05:16.920
Komura-kun, what was it 
that you wanted from me?

05:16.920 --> 05:19.610
<i>God... please...</i>

05:19.610 --> 05:20.410
<i>God!</i>

05:21.870 --> 05:24.500
Something about me giving you something?

05:24.500 --> 05:26.500
Sorry if I forgot.

05:26.500 --> 05:29.430
Oh, no, well, err...

05:30.480 --> 05:32.750
Would you like a taste?

05:32.750 --> 05:34.340
Nice work, shop staff!

05:34.340 --> 05:35.740
<i>I can change the subject!</i>

05:35.740 --> 05:37.600
Mie-san, they're giving out free samples.

05:38.330 --> 05:40.860
<i>Damn it! Dug my own grave!</i>

05:41.440 --> 05:42.350
You're right.

05:42.350 --> 05:43.560
It smells good.

05:43.560 --> 05:45.710
Chocolates, maybe?

05:43.560 --> 05:45.710
Mie-san, they have meat over there!

05:45.710 --> 05:46.680
Meat!

05:47.980 --> 05:49.310
May I have one?

05:49.310 --> 05:50.370
Please do.

05:50.860 --> 05:52.840
Are these all chocolates?

05:53.370 --> 05:54.980
They are.

05:54.980 --> 05:58.010
After all, it's almost Valen—

05:56.930 --> 05:59.040
Is this where they're selling chocolates?!

05:59.840 --> 06:01.540
Please help yourself.

06:01.540 --> 06:03.550
I-I'll have one.

06:03.890 --> 06:05.180
Let's go, Mie-san.

06:12.660 --> 06:13.560
Sorry.

06:13.860 --> 06:14.940
Komura-kun,

06:15.420 --> 06:16.850
your hand's so warm.

06:19.360 --> 06:21.780
My hand's cold, isn't it?

06:21.780 --> 06:23.440
No, not at all.

06:24.150 --> 06:26.740
<i>All I noticed was that it was soft.</i>

06:26.740 --> 06:27.900
Oh, but...

06:28.690 --> 06:31.820
It might actually be 
useful having cold hands.

06:31.820 --> 06:33.870
When you're making chocolates.

06:34.350 --> 06:36.250
Oh, true.

06:37.180 --> 06:40.240
They might not melt as fast.

06:44.690 --> 06:46.680
Are you making chocolates?

06:46.680 --> 06:48.130
Huh? Yeah.

06:48.400 --> 06:50.970
I mean, it's Valentine's Day soon.

06:52.920 --> 06:55.160
Oh, are they decorating for Valentine's Day?

06:55.160 --> 06:57.470
Is that why everything's so red?

06:57.680 --> 07:01.270
Oh, and that king's-grave-looking-thing
was a mountain of chocolates!

07:02.760 --> 07:05.120
Mie-san, there's the mayo.

07:05.120 --> 07:06.860
There's mayo over there.

07:07.460 --> 07:12.870
Oh, hang on, were you saying you 
wanted me to give you chocolates?

07:12.870 --> 07:16.030
<i>That's right!</i>

07:18.140 --> 07:20.560
<i>Sh-She got me!</i>

07:21.400 --> 07:24.540
<i>She figured out I have feelings!</i>

07:24.540 --> 07:25.420
<i>What now?</i>

07:25.930 --> 07:27.940
<i>Please don't reject me!</i>

07:27.940 --> 07:30.920
<i>Don't hate me, Mie-san!</i>

07:31.840 --> 07:34.240
You like chocolates too, huh?

07:36.710 --> 07:38.430
Yeah, I guess.

07:38.890 --> 07:42.440
I was going to give all my friends some.

07:43.160 --> 07:45.420
So I'll give you some, too.

07:46.240 --> 07:47.340
Your friends?

07:48.620 --> 07:51.200
I couldn't decide what to make, though.

07:51.850 --> 07:53.950
<i>She didn't figure me out,</i>

07:54.490 --> 07:57.950
<i>but I guess she doesn't think 
anything of me to begin with.</i>

07:58.200 --> 07:59.920
Would you like one?

07:59.920 --> 08:00.700
Thank you.

07:59.920 --> 08:00.700
<i>Though...</i>

08:02.370 --> 08:04.250
<i>Friend chocolates would be nice, too.</i>

08:05.710 --> 08:09.210
<b>Class 2-B</b>

08:11.720 --> 08:14.220
Day Duty
Ida  Mizutani

08:14.560 --> 08:16.050
<i>Today's Valentine's Day.</i>

08:16.610 --> 08:20.770
<i>The day you might get chocolates 
from the girl you like.</i>

08:21.920 --> 08:26.300
<i>I'm convinced I'm getting 
chocolates from Mie-san.</i>

08:26.770 --> 08:27.740
<i>That's right...</i>

08:27.740 --> 08:29.110
<i>Because...</i>

08:29.110 --> 08:31.360
<i>She said she'd give me some.</i>

08:29.110 --> 08:31.360
Here, friend chocolates.

08:29.110 --> 08:33.110
Staaare

08:31.360 --> 08:33.110
Thank you!

08:31.360 --> 08:33.110
<i>Friend chocolates, that is.</i>

08:34.130 --> 08:37.550
<i>Mie-san's forgotten her glasses yet again.</i>

08:37.550 --> 08:40.870
<i>I'm glad she isn't having any 
issues giving out her chocolates.</i>

08:41.390 --> 08:43.480
Who gave me these chocolates just now?

08:43.480 --> 08:45.370
<i>I guess she's got </i>some<i> issues.</i>

08:45.960 --> 08:47.870
That was me!

08:47.870 --> 08:48.700
"Me," huh?

08:48.700 --> 08:49.920
Mie-chan...

08:53.060 --> 08:54.930
<i>Friend chocolates...</i>

08:54.930 --> 08:58.210
<i>No, friend chocolates are perfectly fine!</i>

08:58.210 --> 09:00.030
<i>This is an honor!</i>

09:00.030 --> 09:00.930
Komura-kun.

09:02.320 --> 09:03.520
Komura-kun?

09:04.400 --> 09:05.080
Yes?

09:05.960 --> 09:07.600
I brought some chocolates.

09:07.600 --> 09:09.260
Th-Thanks.

09:09.260 --> 09:11.150
I tried making raw chocolates.

09:11.990 --> 09:14.650
That soft stuff.

09:14.650 --> 09:15.930
<i>Yeah.</i>

09:15.930 --> 09:17.910
<i>Very much an honor.</i>

09:21.920 --> 09:22.730
Huh?

09:24.220 --> 09:26.920
I thought I'd kept some for you...

09:27.310 --> 09:28.950
Did I make a mistake?

09:28.950 --> 09:30.400
<i>Oh, no!</i>

09:31.420 --> 09:33.780
S-Sorry, I...

09:33.780 --> 09:35.700
No, it's okay.

09:35.700 --> 09:36.930
Totally.

09:37.340 --> 09:38.430
I appreciate the sentiment.

09:38.430 --> 09:39.730
I'm sorry.

09:41.270 --> 09:43.200
<i>She's so depressed.</i>

09:45.290 --> 09:48.830
<i>Though, I'm pretty bummed, too.</i>

09:50.160 --> 09:51.560
<i>Ah, well.</i>

09:52.170 --> 09:53.940
<i>I'll just look forward 
to chocolates next year.</i>

09:55.430 --> 09:57.950
<i>Is it going to be friend 
chocolates next year, too?</i>

09:59.020 --> 09:59.950
<i>No.</i>

09:59.950 --> 10:02.840
<i>I don't think she'd give me 
any as a confession, but...</i>

10:02.840 --> 10:03.910
<i>What if...</i>

10:03.910 --> 10:05.950
<i>What if I...</i>

10:07.890 --> 10:12.140
<i>C-Confess to her? And if she accepts?</i>

10:19.130 --> 10:20.530
<i>No, no, no!</i>

10:20.530 --> 10:22.040
<i>I need to know my place!</i>

10:22.040 --> 10:24.230
<i>Know your place, me!</i>

10:24.230 --> 10:27.320
<i>I couldn't ever bring myself to confess!</i>

10:27.320 --> 10:28.140
Komura-kun...

10:32.130 --> 10:33.030
Um...

10:34.790 --> 10:35.790
Hey...

10:36.970 --> 10:39.530
Do you have time after school today?

11:07.730 --> 11:12.480
So I was thinking I want to at 
least give you something else.

11:15.210 --> 11:20.490
You're a friend, too, so
I can't stand leaving you out.

11:20.490 --> 11:21.740
N-No...

11:21.740 --> 11:23.930
You don't have to worry about it.

11:23.930 --> 11:29.020
So I thought I'd think of something 
before the end of school...

11:29.020 --> 11:30.750
But I couldn't.

11:31.530 --> 11:35.380
So this is a lousy alternative, but...

11:36.180 --> 11:36.940
Yes?

11:38.440 --> 11:41.630
You can ask me to do one thing.

11:45.140 --> 11:46.640
I'll do anything.

11:51.510 --> 11:54.600
N-No, that's... But...

11:54.600 --> 11:56.190
Really, anything.

11:56.440 --> 11:58.620
Justness. Resolution.

11:58.620 --> 12:00.320
I want to make this right.

12:01.130 --> 12:02.570
No, no, but...

12:02.830 --> 12:03.450
But...

12:21.200 --> 12:23.820
I-In that case...

12:28.280 --> 12:32.280
I want you to listen to 
what I'm about to say.

12:42.480 --> 12:43.240
<i>I'm sure...</i>

12:44.390 --> 12:47.260
<i>I'm sure I look pathetic about now.</i>

12:47.790 --> 12:49.410
<i>Of course I do.</i>

12:50.260 --> 12:52.560
<i>She might hate me for this.</i>

12:52.560 --> 12:55.500
<i>It might end our relationship.</i>

12:56.520 --> 12:58.720
<i>I'm worried as hell.</i>

13:02.280 --> 13:04.110
<i>But right now...</i>

13:04.910 --> 13:08.190
<i>Right now, when Mie-san can't see my face...</i>

13:10.890 --> 13:15.020
<i>I might be able to tell her how I feel.</i>

13:26.310 --> 13:27.080
I...

13:27.730 --> 13:28.160
I...

13:30.940 --> 13:31.860
I...

13:42.640 --> 13:43.580
Are you done?

13:48.440 --> 13:49.410
Sorry.

13:50.640 --> 13:52.290
<i>I couldn't get my voice out.</i>

13:53.550 --> 13:55.730
I don't think I'll tell you now.

13:55.730 --> 13:58.940
It doesn't feel right.

13:59.400 --> 14:01.960
Oh, did you have to go to the bathroom?

14:02.430 --> 14:04.100
It's not that, but...

14:04.100 --> 14:05.940
I-I'll tell you properly next time.

14:06.640 --> 14:10.660
I'll tell you some other time, when 
you're actually seeing my face.

14:14.800 --> 14:16.000
Okay.

14:16.000 --> 14:19.290
I'll have to be careful not 
to forget my glasses, then.

14:25.310 --> 14:29.510
But, but I'll wait until I'm ready.

14:29.980 --> 14:30.990
Okay.

14:30.990 --> 14:31.860
I'll be waiting.

14:33.610 --> 14:37.590
<i>Does she actually know 
what I was about to say?!</i>

14:37.590 --> 14:38.150
Oh...

14:41.460 --> 14:42.560
I found a chocolate.

14:43.710 --> 14:45.690
It was supposed to be my snack, but...

14:46.030 --> 14:47.690
Here, friend chocolate.

14:49.120 --> 14:50.400
Friend chocolate.

14:50.960 --> 14:53.510
<i>She definitely doesn't get it.</i>

14:54.900 --> 14:59.650
Sounds like it's something hard to 
talk about, so you can take your time.

14:59.650 --> 15:00.460
Okay.

15:01.360 --> 15:02.810
<i>Next year, for sure.</i>

15:05.320 --> 15:06.910
<i>By next year.</i>

15:24.520 --> 15:27.480
<b>Class 2-B</b>

15:28.990 --> 15:31.600
<i>It's been a month since Valentine's Day.</i>

15:34.920 --> 15:37.550
<i>It's so-called White Day today.</i>

15:39.200 --> 15:40.860
<i>This isn't creepy of me, is it?</i>

15:41.460 --> 15:43.530
<i>I'm just returning the favor, right?</i>

15:43.530 --> 15:44.840
<i>It's okay, right?</i>

15:46.020 --> 15:47.240
Oh, Mie-san.

15:47.240 --> 15:48.310
Morn—

15:51.810 --> 15:52.720
...ing.

15:53.100 --> 15:54.330
Morning.

15:55.010 --> 15:56.840
Wh-What's wrong?

15:56.840 --> 15:58.500
You seem kinda down.

15:58.500 --> 16:01.180
I skipped my morning cocoa.

16:01.830 --> 16:03.020
You did?

16:03.020 --> 16:06.310
Oh, I haven't brought my glasses again.

16:06.640 --> 16:09.320
<i>Her mind's behind tempo.</i>

16:09.720 --> 16:13.070
It was Valentine's Day the other day, right?

16:13.340 --> 16:14.570
Urp.

16:14.990 --> 16:18.750
And I got quite a few friend chocolates.

16:18.750 --> 16:19.370
Yeah?

16:19.830 --> 16:24.330
And I was eating those, and...

16:24.570 --> 16:28.130
I realized I'd have to hold off for a while.

16:31.740 --> 16:35.570
So I'd like your cooperation 
as well, Komura-kun.

16:36.770 --> 16:40.640
If I appear on the verge 
of a gluttonous rampage...

16:40.640 --> 16:43.360
I ask you to be the one to stop me.

16:43.360 --> 16:45.350
<i>She's in warrior mode again.</i>

16:45.860 --> 16:47.810
G-Got it.

16:47.810 --> 16:49.360
I'll help out.

16:49.360 --> 16:50.730
Thanks.

16:52.720 --> 16:57.100
<i>Doesn't look like I'm going 
to be able to give her this.</i>

16:57.690 --> 16:59.140
Morning, Mie-san.

16:59.620 --> 17:00.700
Azuma-kun!

17:01.280 --> 17:03.460
Mie-san, hold your hands out.

17:05.600 --> 17:07.920
Here, if you'd like.

17:08.410 --> 17:09.960
You!

17:10.630 --> 17:13.060
Remember, you gave me chocolates 
on Valentine's day?

17:13.060 --> 17:14.380
This is in return.

17:17.000 --> 17:19.890
<i>She identified it by scent 
before she could see it!</i>

17:20.240 --> 17:22.020
In return?

17:22.020 --> 17:23.890
Yeah, it's White Day today.

17:24.160 --> 17:26.450
You were giving out lots.

17:26.450 --> 17:29.400
So I bet you'll be getting quite a few back.

17:29.840 --> 17:32.080
Lots of snacks...

17:32.080 --> 17:33.500
<i>She's in despair.</i>

17:34.150 --> 17:37.200
<i>N-No fair, Azuma-kun!</i>

17:36.410 --> 17:41.410
<b>"Stand Strong, Mie!" Pose</b>

17:37.270 --> 17:39.700
<i>I want to give her something, too!</i>

17:39.760 --> 17:41.410
They smell so good.

17:41.680 --> 17:43.330
I have a final weapon.

17:43.850 --> 17:46.540
I'll distract myself with a cough drop.

17:47.950 --> 17:50.210
Mie-san, no!

17:50.460 --> 17:52.740
That's one of the cookies you just got!

17:54.550 --> 17:55.970
It wasn't even intentional.

17:55.970 --> 17:57.530
No, no.

17:57.530 --> 17:58.780
I made a mistake.

17:58.780 --> 18:00.050
Because I don't have my glasses.

18:00.050 --> 18:01.330
Y-Yeah.

18:01.330 --> 18:02.140
I see.

18:02.140 --> 18:05.480
<i>I feel like the problem's bigger than that.</i>

18:11.020 --> 18:14.730
<i>Mie-san might be at her limit already.</i>

18:15.230 --> 18:17.590
<i>She did tell me, though...</i>

18:17.590 --> 18:20.410
<i>To stop her if she's about to eat one.</i>

18:20.830 --> 18:24.660
<i>I'm gonna do what 
I've been asked to do.</i>

18:25.690 --> 18:27.090
Hey! Wait!

18:27.090 --> 18:28.820
Mie-san, that's a snack!

18:28.820 --> 18:30.290
It's not a cough drop!

18:33.410 --> 18:36.810
Oh, I thought it was a troche.

18:36.810 --> 18:38.470
Because I don't have my glasses.

18:38.470 --> 18:40.550
<i>Sure, they kinda have the same shape, but...</i>

18:38.470 --> 18:40.550
<b>Troche</b>

18:42.160 --> 18:44.810
<i>Hang on, something's weird.</i>

18:45.850 --> 18:47.310
Mie-san!

18:48.220 --> 18:50.240
These are for the chocolates.

18:50.240 --> 18:51.890
Thanks.

18:59.890 --> 19:02.390
No, you definitely saw me looking!

19:02.390 --> 19:03.870
I definitely caught that!

19:05.280 --> 19:06.860
N-No, I thought...

19:06.860 --> 19:08.790
I thought it's brown sugar...

19:09.220 --> 19:11.320
Brown sugar...

19:11.320 --> 19:13.890
I thought it was a brown sugar cough drop.

19:14.400 --> 19:16.300
Because I don't have my glasses.

19:22.800 --> 19:25.270
<i>Sh-She's doing it on purpose!</i>

19:25.810 --> 19:28.000
<i>Mie-san! You'd do that?!</i>

19:28.000 --> 19:29.900
<i>You'd do that?!</i>

19:30.400 --> 19:31.690
<i>So cute!</i>

19:32.310 --> 19:34.320
<i>But I can't!</i>

19:34.320 --> 19:36.940
<i>I can't let her go against her own word!</i>

19:38.660 --> 19:41.110
<i>It's time for tough love!</i>

19:42.740 --> 19:46.940
J-Just in case you mistake them again...

19:47.950 --> 19:50.080
Maybe I should hold onto them for you.

19:50.550 --> 19:51.680
B-But...

19:51.680 --> 19:53.370
No, but...

19:57.360 --> 19:58.210
Hey!

19:58.210 --> 19:59.510
You can't, Mie-san!

19:59.510 --> 20:00.550
You have to be strong!

20:00.550 --> 20:01.590
One bite...

20:01.590 --> 20:03.050
Just one bite...

20:03.340 --> 20:04.800
Hang in there!

20:04.800 --> 20:07.440
You didn't just give up on your 
cocoa this morning for nothing!

20:07.440 --> 20:09.060
But, but...

20:09.060 --> 20:12.940
I shouldn't let a gift go to waste...

20:18.070 --> 20:19.570
To Mie-san
 From Azuma

20:23.990 --> 20:27.390
I-If you're going to have some, have mine!

20:42.610 --> 20:43.790
No, err...

20:43.790 --> 20:45.020
For White Day?

20:49.540 --> 20:50.470
Yeah.

20:52.060 --> 20:52.980
Err...

20:53.300 --> 20:55.770
You don't have to eat it...

20:56.320 --> 20:57.260
Sorry.

20:57.260 --> 20:58.980
I made things complicated for you.

20:59.310 --> 21:00.800
<i>I want to disappear.</i>

21:00.800 --> 21:03.490
I-I'll take it home.

21:10.720 --> 21:12.500
Thank you.

21:20.400 --> 21:23.010
Thanks, Komura-kun.

21:28.560 --> 21:31.010
<i>Was it a defeat or a victory?</i>

21:31.020 --> 21:35.570
Komura-kun was left with mixed 
feelings about the situation.

21:31.780 --> 21:36.070
<i>Komura-kun was left with mixed 
feelings about the situation.</i>

23:10.870 --> 23:12.150
Komura Kaede here.

23:12.150 --> 23:13.280
I'm going to do the next episode preview.

23:13.710 --> 23:18.750
"Seasons have passed since Komura-kun met 
Mie-san, and it's the beginning of a new term."

23:19.150 --> 23:21.330
Right, it's been a while already.

23:21.740 --> 23:23.040
Time flies.

23:23.600 --> 23:24.750
Seating change?!

23:24.750 --> 23:25.830
O-Of course.

23:25.830 --> 23:28.360
A new term means a new seating arrangement.

23:28.360 --> 23:31.630
I hope I get to sit next to Mie-san again.

23:31.630 --> 23:32.380
Next episode:

23:31.640 --> 23:40.020
Episode 6

23:31.640 --> 23:40.020
The Girl I Like and

23:31.640 --> 23:40.020
I Welcomed The New School Term

23:32.380 --> 23:34.600
"The Girl I Like and I 
Welcomed The New School Term."

23:34.970 --> 23:36.180
Next to Mie-san...

23:36.180 --> 23:37.500
No, that's too much to ask for.

23:37.500 --> 23:39.740
But please let me sit close by!
